# Investigative Question

One of the primary investigative challenges in cryptocurrency fraud investigations involves determining:

**How do investigators identify operational relationships between wallets without relying solely on direct attribution?**

Blockchain investigations increasingly appear to depend on identifying repeated behavioral consistency across transaction flows rather than any single wallet in isolation.

